### Get all persons
GET http://localhost:3001/api/persons

### Delete person
DELETE http://localhost:3001/api/persons/1

### Add person
POST http://localhost:3001/api/persons
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Testi",
    "number": "020202"
}

### Add a faulty person

POST http://localhost:3001/api/persons
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "number": "0100100"
}
